      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "Considering the aforesaid facts and circumstances of the case, in the event of arrest or surrender within six weeks from today, let this petitioner, as named above, be enlarged on bail on furnishing Sanoji Devi vs The State Of Bihar on 19 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/130263534/\n1 bail bond of Rs.10,000/-(ten thousand) with two sureties of the like amount each to the satisfaction of the learned Judicial Magistrate , Ist Class, Patna in connection with Complaint Case No . 4607 (C)\nof 2021 , subject to the conditions laid down under section 438 of the Code of Criminal Procedure.\n(Prabhat Kumar Singh, J) Kaushik/-\nU T Sanoji Devi vs The State Of Bihar on 19 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/130263534/\n2",
